{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crescent County is a delivery life-sim where you move to a witch-tech island and explore its painterly open world on the back of your scrappy, souped-up motorbroom! Make deliveries to the locals, trick out your broom, and race your new friends (and crushes) in this joyful, cosy-with-bite, slice-of-life game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d7b592e2ca97e6b40bae226310e85c45.webp?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/f7014ec0c92b77768a66b01e9d476edf.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/f7014ec0c92b77768a66b01e9d476edf.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day you\u2019re a motorbroom courier: delivering packages, herding sheep, and fixing leylines. Help the locals and get to know their struggles and endless drama (plus earning yourself a little bit of cash). Plan your day by picking your jobs and broom setup, and then zoom around getting things done! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/7c7c833f17fe7dcd6c9529f70841df11.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d12017d2cf99b9f1f36106d2b31340c3.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d12017d2cf99b9f1f36106d2b31340c3.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After you\u2019ve made some money, head down to Bo\u2019s workshop to upgrade your motorbroom and make it your own! Replace parts to improve your broom\u2019s handling, top speed, gliding ability, or carrying capacity (plus make it look cool as hell). Pop some Sigil Stickers on it to enable special powers such as Phase Shift and Time Rewind. The better your broom is the more jobs you can do, and the more gossip you can uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/786f32738a7eee13e6e222d5dc176248.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/b4d738052a9ae582080439154461043a.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/b4d738052a9ae582080439154461043a.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Lu, a messy young adult, figuring yourself out. Get to know a chaotic cast of characters, and argue, flirt, date, and discover your found family in the island\u2019s punk motorbroom subculture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/6a80edf296fbec9997f6b0abb18f0891.webp?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=61 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/0a17eb394423ee0a30e4f5d5fded2c71.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/0a17eb394423ee0a30e4f5d5fded2c71.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bo and Aster got you into motorbrooms, now it\u2019s time to race them! Use your customised motorbroom to challenge your new friends. Discover shortcuts on ancient leylines, boost through wind turbines, and sprint through abandoned power stations in rebellious, secret races to impress your rival/massive crush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.mp4?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Crescent County is in active development, so make sure to add us to your wishlist to stay up-to-date! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2202650?t=1763462635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763462635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/432846db9985772f3fbd3d4f755ba8f10569696e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763462635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/432846db9985772f3fbd3d4f755ba8f10569696e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763462635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3373650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Crescent County is a delivery life-sim where you move to a witch-tech island and explore its painterly open world on the back of your scrappy, souped-up motorbroom! Make deliveries to the locals, trick out your broom, and race your new friends (and crushes) in this joyful, cosy-with-bite, slice-of-life game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d7b592e2ca97e6b40bae226310e85c45.webp?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/f7014ec0c92b77768a66b01e9d476edf.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/f7014ec0c92b77768a66b01e9d476edf.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During the day you\u2019re a motorbroom courier: delivering packages, herding sheep, and fixing leylines. Help the locals and get to know their struggles and endless drama (plus earning yourself a little bit of cash). Plan your day by picking your jobs and broom setup, and then zoom around getting things done! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/7c7c833f17fe7dcd6c9529f70841df11.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=74 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d12017d2cf99b9f1f36106d2b31340c3.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/d12017d2cf99b9f1f36106d2b31340c3.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After you\u2019ve made some money, head down to Bo\u2019s workshop to upgrade your motorbroom and make it your own! Replace parts to improve your broom\u2019s handling, top speed, gliding ability, or carrying capacity (plus make it look cool as hell). Pop some Sigil Stickers on it to enable special powers such as Phase Shift and Time Rewind. The better your broom is the more jobs you can do, and the more gossip you can uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/786f32738a7eee13e6e222d5dc176248.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=107 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/b4d738052a9ae582080439154461043a.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/b4d738052a9ae582080439154461043a.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as Lu, a messy young adult, figuring yourself out. Get to know a chaotic cast of characters, and argue, flirt, date, and discover your found family in the island\u2019s punk motorbroom subculture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/6a80edf296fbec9997f6b0abb18f0891.webp?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=61 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/0a17eb394423ee0a30e4f5d5fded2c71.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/0a17eb394423ee0a30e4f5d5fded2c71.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bo and Aster got you into motorbrooms, now it\u2019s time to race them! Use your customised motorbroom to challenge your new friends. Discover shortcuts on ancient leylines, boost through wind turbines, and sprint through abandoned power stations in rebellious, secret races to impress your rival/massive crush. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.poster.avif?t=1763462635\" width=800 height=62 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.webm?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/extras/5747d9d5c4add5d0f166be75ff2df8c2.mp4?t=1763462635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Crescent County is in active development, so make sure to add us to your wishlist to stay up-to-date! </p>","developers":["Electric Saint"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2202650/header.jpg?t=1763462635","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS Holo</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2202650/313525897/110057699f38b5fd6b963633a2f2f49d9fc9a5b4/1751089367/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747863682","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2202650/313525897/110057699f38b5fd6b963633a2f2f49d9fc9a5b4/1751089367/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747863682","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2202650/313525897/110057699f38b5fd6b963633a2f2f49d9fc9a5b4/1751089367/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747863682","id":257142142,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142142/movie480.mp4?t=1747863682","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142142/movie_max.mp4?t=1747863682"},"name":"Kickstarter Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142142/e9ccee45be527968962806c92542f8df5c01103a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747863682","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142142/m